   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"cluster-overview\">\n<p class=\"lead\">Die Microcontroller Abstraction Layer (MCAL) enthält hardware-spezifische Treiber für interne Mikrocontroller-Peripherie (ADC-Wandler, PWM-Generatoren, Hardware-Watchdog) und entkoppelt obere BSW-Schichten von der Silizium-Plattform.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sect\">Module im Cluster</h2>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/adc.html\">\n    <h3>ADC Driver (Adc)</h3>\n    <p>Provides initialization and conversion services for analog-to-digital converters.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 123</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">43 APIs (19 Funktionen, 24 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;Adc.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/pwm.html\">\n    <h3>PWM Driver (Pwm)</h3>\n    <p>Generates pulse-width-modulated signals with configurable duty cycle and period.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 121</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">24 APIs (16 Funktionen, 8 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;Pwm.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/wdg.html\">\n    <h3>Watchdog Driver (Wdg)</h3>\n    <p>Hardware watchdog timer servicing and mode configuration.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 102</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">5 APIs (4 Funktionen, 1 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;Wdg.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
